        "problem": "Given the vectors $x=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]$ and $y=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$, find the distance $\\text{d}(x,y).$",
